{
  "title": "Retry the iOS shopping-list sync when the network returns mid-sync",
  "description": "ShoppingListStore's reconnect observer calls syncIfNeeded, which returns early while isSyncing. \
If the network comes back during a sync that then fails (it likely started offline), pending edits wait for the next manual trigger or edit. \
MealPlanStore handles this with a retryAfterSync flag set by syncIfPending and consumed when the in-flight sync ends (PR #866); give ShoppingListStore the same treatment and mirror the MealPlanStoreTests overlap test.",
